<title>CHINA: Guangxia to issue 30 mln yuan bonds.</title>
<headline>Guangxia to issue 30 mln yuan bonds.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's Guangxia Yinchuan Industry Co Ltd plans to issue 30 million yuan worth of three-year corporate bonds, the company said in a notice in the China Securities newspaper on Friday.</p>
<p>The bonds would carry an annual interest rate of 11 percent.</p>
<p>The issue began on April 10 and will close on May 5, the newspaper said. It gave no more details.</p>
</text>
